## 3. Mass Subdomain Visual Pre-Filter
If you are dealing with 5,000 subdomains, running Nuclei on all of them with heavy templates will take hours and might trigger rate limits.
You can use Puppeteer to rapidly visit all 5,000 domains and take a screenshot of each. You can then use a simple script to sort out the subdomains that return blank pages or error screens, and pass only the highly lucrative, active web applications (like login portals or admin panels) to Nuclei for targeted exploitation. [22] 
